questions.q:
How many times is the letter A printed by the following C program (assume every fork succeeds)?
int main() {
  fork();
  fork();
  printf("A");
  return 0;
}

What is the output of this program on a Unix system?
int main() {
  int x = 10;
  if (fork() == 0) { x = x + 5; printf("%d ", x); }
  else { wait(NULL); printf("%d ", x); }
  return 0;
}
